      class="px-6 py-3 bg-pink-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-full shadow-md hover:bg-gray-200 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200 no-underline"
    >
      Explore More Projects
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="py-20 relative">
